join osiris (Right) leftmost
join vox (Left) rightmost
osiris (Right): So walk me through it again. How does this 'prank' actually work?
vox: A ship. Fling him back. One trillion years.
vox: Light speed. Pointed exactly at this kitchen wall.
vox (Left Angry): In real time, he impacts in five minutes. Terminal velocity.
vox (Left Angry): But from his perspective? Eternal void. Snail pace.
vox: Billions of years just to see the darkness slowly shift from navy to slightly darker navy.
vox (Left Angry): And the soundtrack? A single pure Shepard tone. Pitching upward forever.
osiris (Pro): ... That is wonderfully disproportionate. What did Lucifer even do to you?
vox (Left Angry): He left an empty milk carton in the fridge. With the cap off.
osiris (Pro Angry): Say no more. Horus, is the vessel prepped?
leave vox
join horus (Left) rightmost
horus (Left): Engines purring. Flight plan locked.
leave osiris
leave horus
join vox (Pro Angry LG) center
vox (Pro Angry LG): Enjoy the absolute nothing, Lucifer.
leave vox
