vox (Left Happy): Pull him out at the last second and re-launch him!
vox (Left Happy): One hundred thousand trillion years this time!
osiris (Pro Happy): Now that's what I call divine comedy.
osiris (Pro Happy): And they say the Egyptian pantheon lacks a sense of humor.
